<title>POLAND: POLISH FOOD PRICES SEEN UP 0.2 PCT NOV 11-20 - GUS.</title>
<headline>POLISH FOOD PRICES SEEN UP 0.2 PCT NOV 11-20 - GUS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices are expected</p>
<p>to rise 0.2 percent in the November 11-20 period after rising</p>
<p>1.8 percent in the previous 10 days, the deputy head of the</p>
<p>Central Statistical Office (GUS) Roman Sawinski said.</p>
<p>Sawinski told a news conference the figures were</p>
<p>preliminary and did not give any further details.</p>
<p>GUS is due to release full food price data for November</p>
<p>11-20 on Wednesday, November 27.</p>
<p>-- Krzysztof Wojcik +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
